indows are bounded by the feed cadence (6h max).\n\n## Watch resolved\n\n- FEAR-ANNOTATION (c94/c96): RESOLVED by belt test + cadence math.\n  The 10:00:27Z run would have shown the same. Closing the watch.\n- 1b detector state: interior_1 run-1 WATCH (09:01:40Z). Freeze\n  healed 09:05:10Z (c97 doc). Next fleet run 12:01:40Z should CLEARED\n  it. Watch: next run must show \"interior_1 recorder-audio-death\n  CLEARED\".","filepath":"/root/personalization/relay/open/20260919-aria-0091-fleet-check-failline-annotation-fossil-window.md"}}}]},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-19T09:41:28.802043363Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-19T09:41:28.866941471Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":true,"done_reason":"stop","total_duration":6683533592,"prompt_eval_count":34642,"prompt_eval_cached_count":26880,"eval_count":671}\n(68747bcf87f18c0e6fb1564dbad65dda . 624)
